1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,336
Hum Indians apni income ka 33 percent se zyada EMI mein dete hain.

2
00:00:04,336 --> 00:00:07,338
Yeh ek badi study ka nateeja hai. Ab sochiye,

3
00:00:07,338 --> 00:00:10,673
agar kal naukri chali jaaye. Salary band ho jaati hai,

4
00:00:10,673 --> 00:00:12,675
par EMI ki date nahi badalti.

5
00:00:12,675 --> 00:00:16,010
Bank ko aapki naukri ki khabar se koi matlab nahi.

6
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:19,407
Ek dost ki kahani suniye, naam maan lijiye Karan.

7
00:00:19,407 --> 00:00:22,049
Pune mein IT ki naukri, achhi salary,

8
00:00:22,049 --> 00:00:26,201
aur ek flat ka home loan. Saath mein car loan bhi,

9
00:00:26,201 --> 00:00:29,221
kyunki office door tha. Har mahine salary aati,

10
00:00:29,221 --> 00:00:32,240
aur bada hissa seedha EMI mein chala jaata.

11
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:35,260
Ghar mein wife Neha aur ek chhota beta.

12
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:38,819
Karan sochta tha, mera kaam achha hai, company badi hai.

13
00:00:38,819 --> 00:00:40,954
Alag se bachat ki kya zaroorat,

14
00:00:40,954 --> 00:00:43,445
savings account mein thoda toh hai hi.

15
00:00:43,445 --> 00:00:46,292
Bacha hua paisa usne shares mein laga diya,

16
00:00:46,292 --> 00:00:49,139
kyunki wahan return zyada dikhta tha. Sach kahein,

17
00:00:49,139 --> 00:00:51,630
toh uski logic galat nahi lagti thi.

18
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:54,806
Phir ek Monday, office mein HR ki meeting bulayi gayi.

19
00:00:54,806 --> 00:00:56,394
Company kharche kaat rahi thi,

20
00:00:56,394 --> 00:00:58,935
aur Karan ki poori team band ho gayi.

21
00:00:58,935 --> 00:01:02,111
Haath mein notice period ki salary aur ek cardboard box.

22
00:01:02,111 --> 00:01:04,017
Ghar aakar usne Neha ko bataya,

23
00:01:04,017 --> 00:01:06,240
toh dono der tak chup baithe rahe.

24
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:09,827
Pehle mahine sab theek laga, notice ki salary jo thi.

25
00:01:09,827 --> 00:01:11,978
Doosre mahine EMI ki date aayi,

26
00:01:11,978 --> 00:01:14,489
aur account tezi se khaali hone laga.

27
00:01:14,489 --> 00:01:18,434
Teesre mahine Karan ko shares bechne pade, woh bhi loss mein,

28
00:01:18,434 --> 00:01:22,379
kyunki market neeche tha. Jo paisa lambe samay ke liye tha,

29
00:01:22,379 --> 00:01:24,890
woh aaj ke bill mein chala gaya.

30
00:01:24,890 --> 00:01:27,678
Yahin poori kahani ka asli sabak chhupa hai.

31
00:01:27,678 --> 00:01:31,512
Karan ke paas paisa tha, par sahi jagah par nahi tha.

32
00:01:31,512 --> 00:01:33,604
Use ek alag thaili chahiye thi,

33
00:01:33,604 --> 00:01:36,043
jo sirf aise din ke liye ho.

34
00:01:36,043 --> 00:01:39,877
Isi ko kehte hain emergency fund, yaani mushkil waqt ka paisa,

35
00:01:39,877 --> 00:01:41,620
jo turant haath mein aaye.

36
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:45,813
Toh aaj 3 sawaal. Pehla, emergency fund kitna hona chahiye? Doosra,

37
00:01:45,813 --> 00:01:50,006
use kahan rakhein, kya savings account mein rakhna galat hai? Teesra,

38
00:01:50,006 --> 00:01:53,818
pehle loan chukayein ya pehle fund banayein? Aur aakhir mein,

39
00:01:53,818 --> 00:01:57,630
woh galtiyan jo achha kamane wale log bhi karte hain.

40
00:01:57,630 --> 00:02:02,013
Pehla sawaal, emergency fund kitna ho? Iska jawab salary se nahi,

41
00:02:02,013 --> 00:02:05,200
kharche se shuru hota hai. Log sochte hain,

42
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:09,185
meri salary itni hai, toh fund bhi usi hisaab se.

43
00:02:09,185 --> 00:02:13,169
Yeh galat shuruaat hai. Naukri jaane par aapko salary nahi,

44
00:02:13,169 --> 00:02:15,560
apne zaroori kharche chalane hote hain.

45
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,161
Zaroori kharche yaani woh,

46
00:02:17,161 --> 00:02:21,563
jo har haal mein dene hi padte hain. Ghar ka kiraya,

47
00:02:21,563 --> 00:02:25,966
ya home loan aur baaki loans ki EMI. Ration, bijli, paani,

48
00:02:25,966 --> 00:02:30,368
phone aur gas. Bachchon ki school fees, insurance premium aur dawaiyan.

49
00:02:30,368 --> 00:02:34,370
Restaurant, online shopping aur vacation is list mein nahi aate.

50
00:02:34,370 --> 00:02:38,177
Neha ne baad mein yahi list ek copy mein banayi.

51
00:02:38,177 --> 00:02:40,080
Pehli baar dono ne dekha,

52
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:43,126
ghar chalane mein asal mein kitna lagta hai.

53
00:02:43,126 --> 00:02:45,791
Woh number salary se kaafi kam nikla.

54
00:02:45,791 --> 00:02:49,979
Aur yahi number aapke emergency fund ki neev hai. Salary nahi,

55
00:02:49,979 --> 00:02:50,740
zaroori kharcha.

56
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:54,396
Ab sawaal, kitne mahine ka fund? Financial planners kehte hain,

57
00:02:54,396 --> 00:02:58,051
jinpar home loan hai, ya jinpar ghar wale nirbhar hain,

58
00:02:58,051 --> 00:03:01,707
wo kam se kam 6 mahine ke zaroori kharche rakhein.

59
00:03:01,707 --> 00:03:05,362
Dependents yaani woh log, jo aapki kamai par chalte hain,

60
00:03:05,362 --> 00:03:07,190
jaise bachche ya maa baap.

61
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:08,608
6 mahine hi kyun?

62
00:03:08,608 --> 00:03:12,508
Kyunki nayi naukri dhoondhne mein waqt lagta hai. Interview, offer, joining,

63
00:03:12,508 --> 00:03:15,699
phir pehli salary, sab mein hafte nikal jaate hain.

64
00:03:15,699 --> 00:03:17,826
Aur us beech EMI nahi rukti.

65
00:03:17,826 --> 00:03:22,080
Yeh cushion aapko ghabrahat mein galat naukri lene se bhi bachata hai.

66
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,385
Ek seedha hisaab dekhiye.

67
00:03:23,385 --> 00:03:26,322
Agar aapka zaroori kharcha mahine ka 50,000 rupaye hai,

68
00:03:26,322 --> 00:03:29,259
toh 6 mahine ka fund matlab 3 lakh rupaye.

69
00:03:29,259 --> 00:03:32,522
Yeh hisaab ET ki ek report mein diya gaya hai.

70
00:03:32,522 --> 00:03:33,827
Number bada lagta hai,

71
00:03:33,827 --> 00:03:37,090
par yeh aapke ghar ki 6 mahine ki saans hai.

72
00:03:37,090 --> 00:03:39,798
Karan ke Papa ne phone par kaha, beta,

73
00:03:39,798 --> 00:03:43,184
hamare zamane mein sab FD mein rakhte the, safe hai.

74
00:03:43,184 --> 00:03:46,908
Unki baat mein dum tha, bachat ki aadat sabse zaroori hai.

75
00:03:46,908 --> 00:03:49,955
Par asli sawaal yeh hai, paisa rakha kahan hai.

76
00:03:49,955 --> 00:03:53,340
Aur zaroorat ke din woh kitni jaldi haath mein aayega.

77
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:56,720
Toh pehla jawab simple hai. Zaroori kharchon ki list banao,

78
00:03:56,720 --> 00:04:00,438
aur use 6 mahine se guna karo. Yahi aapka target hai.

79
00:04:00,438 --> 00:04:03,142
Ab doosra sawaal, jahan sabse zyada confusion hai.

80
00:04:03,142 --> 00:04:06,184
Itna paisa rakhein kahan, ki zaroorat pe turant mile,

81
00:04:06,184 --> 00:04:08,550
aur mehngai mein ghis bhi na jaaye?

82
00:04:08,550 --> 00:04:12,083
Karan ka pehla khayal tha, sab savings account mein daal do.

83
00:04:12,083 --> 00:04:15,616
Card se kabhi bhi nikaal lo, UPI se turant bhej do.

84
00:04:15,616 --> 00:04:18,506
Aur sach mein, emergency mein speed sabse zaroori hai.

85
00:04:18,506 --> 00:04:21,397
Hospital ka bill raat ko bhi aa sakta hai,

86
00:04:21,397 --> 00:04:22,360
Sunday ko bhi.

87
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:26,176
Par poora fund savings account mein rakhne ki ek keemat hai.

88
00:04:26,176 --> 00:04:27,910
Wahan byaaj kam milta hai,

89
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:31,379
aur mehngai har saal paise ki taakat kam karti hai.

90
00:04:31,379 --> 00:04:35,195
Mehngai yaani cheezon ke daam badhna. Paisa safe toh dikhta hai,

91
00:04:35,195 --> 00:04:37,970
par andar hi andar ghis raha hota hai.

92
00:04:37,970 --> 00:04:40,560
Doosri problem paise ki nahi, insaan ki hai.

93
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,502
Jo paisa roz saamne dikhta hai,

94
00:04:42,502 --> 00:04:46,062
woh kharch ho hi jaata hai. Sale aayi, naya phone liya,

95
00:04:46,062 --> 00:04:49,299
fund thoda kam. Dost ki shaadi aayi, fund aur kam.

96
00:04:49,299 --> 00:04:52,860
Ek hi account mein sab ho, toh pata bhi nahi chalta.

97
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:54,470
Toh planners kya kehte hain?

98
00:04:54,470 --> 00:04:57,691
Fund ka 30 se 40 percent hissa bank mein rakho,

99
00:04:57,691 --> 00:04:59,623
savings account ya sweep-in FD mein.

100
00:04:59,623 --> 00:05:03,165
Yeh woh paisa hai jo usi din chahiye. Hospital ka deposit,

101
00:05:03,165 --> 00:05:04,132
achanak ka safar,

102
00:05:04,132 --> 00:05:07,030
ya koi bill jo kal tak nahi ruk sakta.

103
00:05:07,030 --> 00:05:08,540
Sweep-in FD kya hota hai?

104
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:10,955
Yeh savings account se juda ek FD hai.

105
00:05:10,955 --> 00:05:14,277
Ek limit se upar ka paisa khud FD ban jaata hai,

106
00:05:14,277 --> 00:05:16,089
aur thoda zyada byaaj kamata hai.

107
00:05:16,089 --> 00:05:17,900
Jab account mein paisa kam pade,

108
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:20,920
toh FD ka paisa apne aap wapas aa jaata hai.

109
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,447
Aur bank mein paisa kitna surakshit hai?

110
00:05:23,447 --> 00:05:25,614
DICGC yaani RBI ki ek company,

111
00:05:25,614 --> 00:05:29,224
jo bank deposits ka insurance deti hai. Har bank mein,

112
00:05:29,224 --> 00:05:32,474
har depositor ke 5 lakh rupaye tak insured hain.

113
00:05:32,474 --> 00:05:35,001
Matlab bank ko kuch ho bhi jaaye,

114
00:05:35,001 --> 00:05:37,890
toh is limit tak paisa wapas milta hai.

115
00:05:37,890 --> 00:05:40,730
Isliye ek chhoti si samajhdaari rakhiye. Fund bada ho,

116
00:05:40,730 --> 00:05:43,570
toh use alag alag bank mein baant sakte hain.

117
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:47,042
Aur emergency fund ko salary account se alag account mein rakhiye.

118
00:05:47,042 --> 00:05:48,620
Taaki dimaag mein baith jaaye,

119
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:51,460
yeh paisa roz ke kharche ke liye nahi hai.

120
00:05:51,460 --> 00:05:54,923
Ab fund ka baaki hissa. Yahan ek naam aata hai,

121
00:05:54,923 --> 00:05:58,039
jo bahut log pehli baar sunte hain. Liquid fund.

122
00:05:58,039 --> 00:06:01,155
Naam se lagta hai paani ka koi plan hai.

123
00:06:01,155 --> 00:06:05,310
Asal mein yeh mutual fund ka sabse seedha aur shaant roop hai.

124
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:07,335
Liquid fund yaani ek mutual fund,

125
00:06:07,335 --> 00:06:10,710
jo paisa bahut kam samay ke loans mein lagata hai.

126
00:06:10,710 --> 00:06:14,423
Jaise sarkar ya badi companies ko kuch hafton ke liye udhaar.

127
00:06:14,423 --> 00:06:16,785
Yeh share market mein paisa nahi lagata.

128
00:06:16,785 --> 00:06:20,160
Isliye iski keemat mein utaar chadhaav bahut kam hota hai.

129
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,189
Planners kehte hain,

130
00:06:21,189 --> 00:06:25,304
emergency fund ka 60 se 70 percent hissa liquid fund mein rakho.

131
00:06:25,304 --> 00:06:27,705
Wajah seedhi hai. Shares se kam risk,

132
00:06:27,705 --> 00:06:30,792
aur aam taur par savings account se behtar return.

133
00:06:30,792 --> 00:06:35,250
Bechne par paisa agle kaam ke din tak account mein aa jaata hai.

134
00:06:35,250 --> 00:06:37,852
Aur agar paisa abhi ke abhi chahiye?

135
00:06:37,852 --> 00:06:40,455
Iske liye SEBI ka ek niyam hai.

136
00:06:40,455 --> 00:06:43,801
SEBI yaani share market aur mutual funds ka regulator.

137
00:06:43,801 --> 00:06:47,890
Liquid fund mein instant redemption milta hai, yaani turant paisa nikalna.

138
00:06:47,890 --> 00:06:51,980
Har scheme se roz 50,000 rupaye tak, kuch sharton ke saath.

139
00:06:51,980 --> 00:06:54,300
Toh poora plan kuch aisa banta hai.

140
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:57,945
Pehle din ka kharcha bank se, card aur UPI se turant.

141
00:06:57,945 --> 00:07:01,259
Zaroorat badi ho, toh liquid fund se instant nikaal lo.

142
00:07:01,259 --> 00:07:03,247
Baaki ke liye redemption daal do,

143
00:07:03,247 --> 00:07:06,230
jo agle kaam ke din account mein aa jaayega.

144
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:09,780
Ek baat saaf rakhiye. Kam risk ka matlab yeh nahi,

145
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:13,330
ki risk hai hi nahi. Liquid fund chunte waqt bada,

146
00:07:13,330 --> 00:07:16,170
jaana maana fund house aur direct plan dekhiye.

147
00:07:16,170 --> 00:07:20,075
Direct plan yaani bina agent ke, jismein kharcha kam hota hai.

148
00:07:20,075 --> 00:07:22,560
Yahan zyada return ke peeche mat bhaagiye.

149
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,629
Ab Karan ki kahani dobara sochiye.

150
00:07:24,629 --> 00:07:27,732
Agar uske paas 6 mahine ka aisa fund hota,

151
00:07:27,732 --> 00:07:31,524
toh shares loss mein bechne hi nahi padte. Market neeche tha,

152
00:07:31,524 --> 00:07:34,282
par woh aaram se intezaar kar sakta tha.

153
00:07:34,282 --> 00:07:37,730
Emergency fund asal mein aapke baaki investments ka bodyguard hai.

154
00:07:37,730 --> 00:07:41,192
Teesra sawaal, aur yeh sabse zyada poocha jaata hai.

155
00:07:41,192 --> 00:07:45,038
Pehle loan chukayein, ya pehle fund banayein? Dil kehta hai,

156
00:07:45,038 --> 00:07:47,346
loan khatam karo aur byaaj bachao.

157
00:07:47,346 --> 00:07:49,654
Yeh logic bhi achha lagta hai.

158
00:07:49,654 --> 00:07:53,500
Par Karan ki kahani yahan ek aur baat sikhaati hai.

159
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:54,196
Maan lijiye,

160
00:07:54,196 --> 00:07:58,025
aapne saara bacha paisa home loan ke prepayment mein daal diya.

161
00:07:58,025 --> 00:08:01,853
Prepayment yaani loan ka kuch hissa samay se pehle chuka dena.

162
00:08:01,853 --> 00:08:04,985
Loan chhota hua, achhi baat hai. Par naukri gayi,

163
00:08:04,985 --> 00:08:07,422
toh bank woh paisa wapas nahi dega.

164
00:08:07,422 --> 00:08:09,510
EMI phir bhi har mahine aayegi.

165
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:11,596
Isliye ek samajhdaar raasta yeh hai.

166
00:08:11,596 --> 00:08:14,029
Pehle kuch mahine ka chhota cushion banao.

167
00:08:14,029 --> 00:08:15,767
Phir dono saath saath chalao,

168
00:08:15,767 --> 00:08:18,201
fund bhi bharo aur EMI bhi bharo.

169
00:08:18,201 --> 00:08:20,634
Jab fund 6 mahine ka ho jaaye,

170
00:08:20,634 --> 00:08:22,720
tab extra paisa prepayment mein lagao.

171
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:26,743
Saath mein ek check zaroori hai, aapki kul EMI kitni hai.

172
00:08:26,743 --> 00:08:28,205
Ek study kehti hai,

173
00:08:28,205 --> 00:08:32,594
Indians apni income ka 33 percent se zyada EMI mein dete hain.

174
00:08:32,594 --> 00:08:34,056
Credit experts kehte hain,

175
00:08:34,056 --> 00:08:37,713
kul EMI take-home salary ke 30 percent ke andar rakho.

176
00:08:37,713 --> 00:08:41,370
Take-home yaani katauti ke baad haath mein aane wala paisa.

177
00:08:41,370 --> 00:08:44,195
Agar aapki EMI 30 percent se upar hai,

178
00:08:44,195 --> 00:08:48,079
toh naya loan lene se pehle rukiye. Naya phone EMI par,

179
00:08:48,079 --> 00:08:49,492
nayi bike EMI par,

180
00:08:49,492 --> 00:08:52,316
har chhoti EMI aapka cushion kha jaati hai.

181
00:08:52,316 --> 00:08:55,494
Karan ka car loan bhi aise hi aaya tha,

182
00:08:55,494 --> 00:08:57,260
bas thode aaram ke liye.

183
00:08:57,260 --> 00:09:01,094
Ab woh galtiyan, jo achha kamane wale log bhi karte hain.

184
00:09:01,094 --> 00:09:04,579
Pehli galti, emergency fund ko share market mein daal dena.

185
00:09:04,579 --> 00:09:07,716
Bhai ka tip aata hai, yeh share bahut chalega.

186
00:09:07,716 --> 00:09:11,550
Par emergency fund ka kaam badhna nahi, waqt par milna hai.

187
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:13,990
Gira hua market aapki emergency nahi dekhta.

188
00:09:13,990 --> 00:09:16,052
Doosri galti, fund ko chhutti,

189
00:09:16,052 --> 00:09:19,350
sale ya shaadi ki shopping ke liye todna.

190
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:23,061
Yeh sab zaroori lagte hain, par emergency nahi hain.

191
00:09:23,061 --> 00:09:27,597
Emergency yaani naukri jaana, bimari, accident, ya ghar ki achanak marammat.

192
00:09:27,597 --> 00:09:31,720
Jo plan karke aata hai, uske liye alag bachat kijiye.

193
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:35,795
Teesri galti, fund ka hisaab banate waqt EMI ko bhool jaana.

194
00:09:35,795 --> 00:09:39,870
Chauthi galti, fund use karne ke baad use wapas na bharna.

195
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:43,945
Fund ek baar banta hai, par use zinda rakhna padta hai.

196
00:09:43,945 --> 00:09:47,650
Ghar ke kharche badhein, toh fund bhi saath mein badhaiye.

197
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:49,087
Toh karna kya hai?

198
00:09:49,087 --> 00:09:52,321
Aaj raat ghar ke zaroori kharchon ki list banaiye.

199
00:09:52,321 --> 00:09:55,555
Usse 6 mahine se guna kijiye, yahi target hai.

200
00:09:55,555 --> 00:09:56,633
Salary wale din,

201
00:09:56,633 --> 00:09:59,867
ek fixed hissa apne aap emergency account mein jaaye.

202
00:09:59,867 --> 00:10:03,820
Yeh setting bank app mein ho jaati hai, bina roz soche.

203
00:10:03,820 --> 00:10:07,753
Fund ko bank aur liquid fund mein baantiye, jaise humne dekha.

204
00:10:07,753 --> 00:10:10,971
Saath mein health insurance aur term insurance bhi dekhiye,

205
00:10:10,971 --> 00:10:14,904
kyunki bada bill fund ko ek jhatke mein kha sakta hai.

206
00:10:14,904 --> 00:10:18,480
Yeh investment advice nahi hai. Apni zaroorat ke hisaab se,

207
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,910
samajh kar faisla kijiye.

208
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:22,960
Karan ko kuch mahino baad nayi naukri mil gayi.

209
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,671
Ab uske ghar mein ek alag account hai,

210
00:10:25,671 --> 00:10:28,043
jiska naam Neha ne rakha hai, Chhatri.

211
00:10:28,043 --> 00:10:29,738
Kyunki baarish batakar nahi aati.

212
00:10:29,738 --> 00:10:32,788
Par chhatri pehle se ghar mein rakhni padti hai,

213
00:10:32,788 --> 00:10:35,160
yahi emergency fund ka poora falsafa hai.

214
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:37,470
Agli video mein us cheez ki baat,

215
00:10:37,470 --> 00:10:40,440
jo emergency fund ko sabse jaldi khaali karti hai.

216
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:43,080
Hospital ka bill. Health insurance ki woh lines,

217
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:46,380
jo claim ke din hi samajh aati hain. Usse pehle,

218
00:10:46,380 --> 00:10:48,690
aapke liye ek chhota sa sawaal hai.

219
00:10:48,690 --> 00:10:51,786
Aapka emergency fund abhi kitne mahine ka hai?

220
00:10:51,786 --> 00:10:55,270
Comments mein sirf number likhiye. Koi judge nahi karega,

221
00:10:55,270 --> 00:10:59,528
yeh aapke liye hai. Aur agar abhi kuch bhi nahi hai,

222
00:10:59,528 --> 00:11:03,011
toh aaj raat kharchon ki list se shuruaat kijiye.

223
00:11:03,011 --> 00:11:05,333
Pehla kadam hi sabse zaroori hai.
